  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "We are at Grandma's house. It is dinner. The table has eight chairs. Mom and Dad sit too. Grandma has rice. She has fish and chicken. She has bread too.",
      "\"Rice, please,\" says Lily. \"Here you are,\" says Grandma. \"Thank you!\" \"Is it good?\" asks Grandma. \"Yes!\" says Lily. Tom drinks water. Oh no! The water is on the table. \"Sorry!\" says Tom. \"Don't worry,\" says Grandpa.",
      "Now we eat. Pip sits under the table. He wants chicken. \"No, Pip,\" says Lily. Grandma has a cake. \"Cake, please!\" says Tom. Our family is happy."
    ],
    "summary": "The family has dinner at Grandma's house. Tom is sorry about the water on the table. At the end, Grandma has a cake.",
